  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "num": "01",
      "en": "Hi! My name is Adam and I'm a {freshman} at senior high school. Going from junior high school to senior high school is a really big {challenge}. The first week was a little {confusing}.",
      "cn": "嗨！我叫亚当，是高中一年级的新生。从初中过渡到高中真是一项巨大的挑战。第一周有点让人困惑。"
    },
    {
      "num": "02",
      "en": "First, I had to think very carefully about which courses I wanted to take. The school adviser helped me choose the {suitable} ones: maths, English, chemistry, world history, and Chinese. I know that Chinese is a very difficult language, but I hope to be {fluent} when I {graduate}. My adviser recommended that I should sign up for {advanced} {literature} because I like English and I'm good at it.",
      "cn": "首先，我必须非常认真地考虑我想选哪些课程。学校的指导老师帮我选了合适的：数学、英语、化学、世界史和中文。我知道中文是一门非常难学的语言，但我希望毕业时能说得很流利。因为我喜欢英语而且成绩不错，指导老师建议我选修高级文学。"
    },
    {
      "num": "03",
      "en": "I had to choose {{extra}-curricular} activities, too. I tried to join the school football team, but the coach told me that I didn't play well enough. {Obviously}, I was unhappy, but I won't {quit}. I'll find a way to improve on my own so that I can make the team next year. I joined a {volunteer} club instead. Every Wednesday, we work at a soup kitchen and hand out food to homeless people in the community.",
      "cn": "我还得选择课外活动。我试图加入学校足球队，但教练说我踢得不够好。显然，我很不开心，但我不会放弃。我会自己想办法提高，这样明年就能入选球队了。于是我改参加了一个志愿者俱乐部。每个星期三，我们在施舍处干活，把食物分发给社区里无家可归的人。"
    },
    {
      "num": "04",
      "en": "I know I'll have to study harder as a senior high school student and get used to being {responsible} for a lot more. I'm a bit worried about keeping up with the other students in my {advanced} course, and it'll be quite difficult to get used to all the homework. Still, I'm happy to be here. Studying hard isn't always fun, but I'll be well prepared for university or whatever else comes in the future.",
      "cn": "我知道，作为一名高中生，我必须更努力地学习，并习惯对更多的事情负责。我有点担心在高级课程中跟不上其他同学，而且适应所有的作业会相当困难。不过，我还是很高兴来到这里。努力学习并不总是有趣的，但我会为将来上大学或任何其他事情做好充分准备。"
    },
    {
      "num": "05",
      "en": "10 September 2018",
      "cn": "2018 年 9 月 10 日"
    }
  ],
